h a house of horror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/51347760912f58e7027a04a5aabdf66f.poster.avif?t=1762002438\" width=720 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/51347760912f58e7027a04a5aabdf66f.webm?t=1762002438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/51347760912f58e7027a04a5aabdf66f.mp4?t=1762002438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[MYSTERIOUS DUNGEONS]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through the endless halls of the mansion that change every time you enter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/10e9b9f59c0a2a42f8d1812c04906307.poster.avif?t=1762002438\" width=720 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/10e9b9f59c0a2a42f8d1812c04906307.webm?t=1762002438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/10e9b9f59c0a2a42f8d1812c04906307.mp4?t=1762002438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[JUST LIKE BACK IN THE DAY]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the 32-bit classics, House of Necrosis looks and feels like your favorite 90s games.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/7d14c702c97b85640cde9c8e2e805e75.poster.avif?t=1762002438\" width=720 height